2,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who we sit beside. It shapes our week more than the walls do.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We should decide who gets the worse seats on purpose, not by accident.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check the costs first. The budget hasn't changed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,My mornings are already tight. I need to know what the change will take from us.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort is invisible on a map. I want it written down before we move.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, yes. If we don't talk about it, it just happens to us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, exactly. Habit is a poor manager.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Mio, I agree. Knowing the time cost helps me feel less anxious about it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, thanks. It’s not just time, it’s the energy to start the day.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shunichi, I’ll look into the physical setup. The rest is just noise.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I’d like to see what the new people have said about how they learned here.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the past shuffles. They show what happens when we don’t plan.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look at the billing basis. I need to know the real monthly cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the morning routine upstairs. It’s the closest thing to our situation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll get the sound readings and the physio note. Those are the real issues.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let’s see what we find. I hope it helps us talk more openly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,We will. I’ll be watching for the quiet costs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay. I’ll try to stay calm while we look into this.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’m excited to see the data. It might make this less scary.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Good. Let’s get the facts so we can stop guessing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
