30,2,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The new joiners learned by listening. If we scatter them, they lose that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The last two shuffles took two weeks each. We can’t afford that again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The billing is by area, not people. Empty desks still cost us 41,000 yen a month.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Upstairs, just setting up took up to nine minutes. That’s a lot of my morning gone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The printer side is nine decibels louder. And my chair takes days to adjust properly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, that’s a lot of money for empty space. We need to be efficient.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, if the noise is that bad, we have to assign the quiet spots deliberately.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, yes. And moving desks costs 6,200 yen each time. We should be careful.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, I agree. If we rotate, we lose the setup time every time.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, exactly. If we move often, I never get my chair right.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The survey says daylight is the biggest complaint. The plan gives it to only four.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,So the window seats are the prize. We need to decide who gets them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"If we fix the desks, we pay once. If we rotate, we pay every time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"But if we fix them, the people without windows are stuck there forever.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Unless we rotate blocks. But then I lose my chair settings every time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"Maybe we can rotate blocks, but keep the window seats for those who need them?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,That’s a start. We need a rule for who gets the good spots.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think fixed desks by function might be best. It’s cheaper and stable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,But what about the morning setup time? That’s still a problem.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"If we fix the desks, I can finally get my chair right. I’m for that.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
56,3,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
