58,3,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
59,3,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option B seems to respect the need for stability and daylight.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B lets us assign the window seats deliberately. I prefer that.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option B is the cheapest. We only pay the facilities fee once.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option B means I have to set up every morning, but it’s predictable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is the only one where I can keep my chair settings.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, is the setup time really that bad? I worry about your mornings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, it’s four to nine minutes. It’s manageable if we plan it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I’m glad you’re happy. It’s good to have one thing settled.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, I think I can handle it. I just need to know it’s not going to change.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, thanks. It’s a small thing, but it matters to me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,What about the new joiners? Will they still be able to overhear things?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we group by function, they’ll be near people doing similar work.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,That might help them learn faster. I think it’s a good idea.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I hope so. I want them to feel welcome, not isolated.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"As long as they’re not in the noisy row, it should be fine.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I think we’re all leaning toward B. It feels fair and practical.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. It’s the most deliberate choice.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m comfortable with it. It’s the most stable option.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mio,,I’ll vote for B. I can live with the setup time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’m voting for B. My back will thank me.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
